sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant Proxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP
    participant OAuth as OIDC / OpenShift OAuth<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Upstream as Upstream Application<br/>HTTP

    Note over Browser,Upstream: Flow 1: Browser OAuth2/OIDC Authentication
    Browser->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/start
    Proxy->>OAuth: Redirect to authorize endpoint<br/>Client ID, redirect_uri, nonce
    Browser->>OAuth: User login (credentials)
    OAuth->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/callback<br/>Authorization code
    Proxy->>OAuth: POST token endpoint<br/>Client credentials + auth code
    OAuth-->>Proxy: Access token + ID token
    Proxy-->>Browser: Set session cookie
    Browser->>Proxy: GET /* (with session cookie)
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>Headers: GAP-Auth, X-Forwarded-*
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Browser: Proxied response

    Note over Browser,Upstream: Flow 2: K8s Service Account Token Authentication
    participant Client as API Client / MLflow SDK
    Client->>Proxy: Request with Bearer token<br/>(K8s SA token)
    Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST TokenReview<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview result<br/>(authenticated, username, groups)
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>Headers: GAP-Auth
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Client: Proxied response

    Note over Browser,Upstream: Flow 3: Envoy ext_authz Subrequest
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    Envoy->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/auth<br/>Forwarded cookie or Bearer token
    Proxy->>Proxy: Validate session / token
    alt Authenticated
        Proxy-->>Envoy: 202 Accepted<br/>Auth headers
    else Unauthenticated
        Proxy-->>Envoy: 401 Unauthorized
    end
